  <description>
    <p>Aurora is an unofficial Steam desktop client written in Rust. Browse the store and your library in a native interface.</p>
    <p>This experimental sandboxed build is intended for the desktop client. Use a native Aurora package for integration with Steam and Proton.</p>
  </description>
